\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Provide links to the service's terms of service and privacy policy.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Remember, this is for your own legal protection. Use of services must be upfront and well documented. This allows users to ensure that any legal issues with data transmissions are covered.\cb1 \
