\
\cb3 We detected that\'a0
\f0\b the way your plugin references some files
\f1\b0 , directories and/or URLs\'a0
\f0\b may not work with all WordPress setups
\f1\b0 . This happens because there are hardcoded references or you are using the WordPress internal constants.\cb1 \
