\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 Note
\f1\b0 : While the json_decode() function in PHP is useful for decoding JSON strings, it does not sanitize the input. Sanitization refers to the process of cleaning or filtering the input data to ensure that it is safe and secure to use.\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 The json_decode() function simply transforms a JSON string into a PHP array or object. Any potentially malicious data or scripts may persist after json_decode().\cb1 \
